Overview[edit]
It was a four- to five-seater car with four doors and a square-shaped body. The front axle was moved forward, and the side window line was lowered downward. The cabin was overall positioned higher. The roof rails could be changed (by rotating) from longitudinal to transverse.&#91;4&#93;

